{"id":"n52155-2-7","stage":2,"title":"똑똑히 · 聪明地","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52155-2-7-1","ko":"어제 내가 사람들 앞에서 말실수를 한 것 같아.","zh":"我好像昨天在大家面前说错了话。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前面","explanation":"앞：前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"7","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말실수를","meaning":"失言，说错话","explanation":"말실수：失言，说错话；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말실수","audio":"/audio/f5b406408a8e489568c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51735","senseId":"1","lemma":"말실수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"指某种环境或所处的状态。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"f5b406408a8e4895","term":"말실수","zh":"失言，说错话","audio":"/audio/f5b406408a8e489568c7.mp3","entryId":"51735","definition":"因说话失当而犯下的失误；或指那些话。","pronunciation":["말ː실쑤"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/939cbcf0de846d18239c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52155-2-7-2","ko":"저런, 똑똑히 처신했어야지.","zh":"哎呀，本来应该更谨慎地应对的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런,","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"똑똑히","meaning":"聪明地","explanation":"똑똑히：聪明地","readings":[{"term":"똑똑히","audio":"/audio/2dff8d81120cc921380d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52155","senseId":"2","lemma":"똑똑히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처신했어야지.","meaning":"为人处世，处世之道，待人接物","explanation":"처신하다：为人处世，处世之道，待人接物；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"처신하다","audio":"/audio/348c7939cb154efbdec6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78736","senseId":"1","lemma":"처신하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"2dff8d81120cc921","term":"똑똑히","zh":"聪明地","audio":"/audio/2dff8d81120cc921380d.mp3","entryId":"52155","definition":"头脑好，伶俐地。","pronunciation":["똑또키"]},{"id":"348c7939cb154efb","term":"처신하다","zh":"为人处世，处世之道，待人接物","audio":"/audio/348c7939cb154efbdec6.mp3","entryId":"78736","definition":"生活中所需的行为举止。","pronunciation":["처ː신하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4c7308441755087d31cb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.553,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=52155","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":87,"sequenceScore":2.3797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，本来应该更谨慎地应对的啊。","今天的音乐会钢琴演奏真是棒极了。","我好像昨天在大家面前说错了话。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["哎呀，本来应该更谨慎地应对的啊。","我好像昨天在大家面前说错了话。","今天的音乐会钢琴演奏真是棒极了。"],"answer":0}]}
